<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Legato said downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Legato said downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer and Co downgraded Legato Systems Inc to market perform from outperform, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell 4-3/4 to 11-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Late Wednesday the company reported first quarter profit of $0.17 a share compared with a loss of $0.01 a year ago.</p>
</text>
